{"seq":3,"slug":"the-berkshire-path","title":"伯克希尔之路","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/the-berkshire-path","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-partnership-years","title":"合伙公司岁月","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/the-berkshire-path/the-partnership-years","wordCount":1465,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"taking-over-berkshire","title":"接管伯克希尔","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/warren-buffett/life-and-times/the-berkshire-path/taking-over-berkshire","wordCount":1616,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"伯克希尔之路\">伯克希尔之路</h1><p>从投资合伙公司到接管伯克希尔，巴菲特一步步走向投资巨擘。本章追溯这条关键之路。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;合伙公司岁月&quot;——他如何以惊人回报证明价值投资的威力，积累第一桶巨额财富。第二篇文档讲述&quot;接管伯克希尔&quot;,呈现他如何把一家衰败的纺织厂改造为庞大的投资控股帝国。</p>\n"}